          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose na Aroni n'abana be, abe ari bo babamba amahema yabo imbere y'ubuturo mu ruhande rw'iburasirazuba, imbere y'ihema ry'ibonaniro ahagana aho izuba rirasira, barinde Ahera mu cyimbo cy'Abisirayeli baharindishijwe. Utari uwo muri bo wigira hafi yicwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ababazwe bose bo mu Balewi, abo Mose na Aroni babaze babitegetswe n'Uwiteka nk'uko imiryango yabo iri, abahungu n'abagabo bose bahereye ku bamaze ukwezi bavutse, bari inzovu ebyiri n'ibihumbi bibiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
