          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwiteka abwira Mose ati “Bara abahungu b'imfura bose b'Abisirayeli, uhereye ku bamaze ukwezi bavutse, wandike umubare w'amazina yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jyewe Uwiteka untoranirize Abalewi, babe ingurane z'imfura zose z'Abisirayeli, kandi umpe n'amatungo y'Abalewi, abe ingurane z'uburiza bw'amatungo y'Abisirayeli bwose.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose abara imfura zose z'Abisirayeli uko Uwiteka yamutegetse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abahungu b'imfura bose babazwe bahereye ku bamaze ukwezi bavutse, umubare w'amazina yabo uba inzovu ebyiri n'ibihumbi bibiri na magana abiri na mirongo irindwi na batatu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
