          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwiteka abwira Mose ati ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tora Abalewi babe ingurane z'imfura z'Abisirayeli, utore n'amatungo y'Abalewi abe ingurane z'amatungo yabo. Abalewi babe ingurane z'amatungo yabo, Abalewi babe abanjye. Ndi Uwiteka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi kugira ngo imfura z'Abisirayeli magana abiri na mirongo irindwi n'eshatu, zisāze umubare w'Abalewi zicungurwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ubake shekeli eshanu z'imfura imwe, uzende zigezwe kuri shekeli y'Ahera. Ni yo gera makumyabiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uhe Aroni n'abana be ifeza z'incungu z'izo mpfura zisāzeho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose yaka ifeza z'incungu imfura zisāze ku zacunguwe n'Abalewi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifeza yatse izo mpfura z'Abisirayeli ziba shekeli igihumbi na magana atatu na mirongo irindwi n'eshanu zigezwe ku y'Ahera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izo feza z'incungu Mose aziha Aroni n'abana be uko ijambo ry'Uwiteka ryategetse, uko Uwiteka yategetse Mose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.51"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
